&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;Income taxes are&amp;#8239;accrued&amp;#8239;in accordance with&amp;#8239;the FERC Policy Statement on Income Tax Allowance&amp;#8239;permitting&amp;#8239;the accrual of income taxes on a pass-through entity and the associated taxes&amp;#8239;accrued&amp;#8239;are treated as&amp;#8239;deemed&amp;#8239;contributions from the owners,&amp;#8239;whereas&amp;#8239;net operating loss carryovers are treated as&amp;#8239;deemed&amp;#8239;distributions. The deemed contribution recorded was $43.4&amp;#8239;million in&amp;#160;2025&amp;#8239;and&amp;#8239;$40.0 million in&amp;#160;2024&amp;#8239;and was included within Other Paid-in Capital in the Comparative Balance Sheet. We will make all necessary adjustments to account balances upon a ruling in Docket No. AC18-229-000.&amp;#8239;&amp;#8239;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;On December 22, 2017, the United States enacted the &amp;#8220;Tax Cuts and Jobs Act&amp;#8221; (&amp;#8220;TCJA&amp;#8221;). The changes in the TCJA are effective for taxation years beginning after December 31, 2017. While the changes are broad and complex, the most&amp;#8239;significant change&amp;#8239;is the reduction in the corporate federal income tax rate from 35% to 21%. We recorded a $157.2 million decrease to our 2017 deferred income tax liability, a $53.6 million increase to our 2017 deferred income tax&amp;#8239;asset&amp;#8239;and an&amp;#8239;offsetting&amp;#8239;increase of $210.8 million to our regulatory liability.&amp;#8239;&amp;#8239;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;In 2018&amp;#8239;pursuant to&amp;#8239;guidance&amp;#8239;established&amp;#8239;in FERC Docket No. PL19-2-000, we began amortizing the regulated liability&amp;#8239;utilizing&amp;#8239;the Reverse South Georgia flowback&amp;#8239;methodology&amp;#8239;over the 59.3-year remaining life of the assets. In 2025&amp;#8239;and 2024, respectively, we recorded a $3.5&amp;#8239;million decrease to regulatory liability, a $0.9&amp;#8239;million decrease to our deferred income tax&amp;#8239;asset&amp;#8239;and an offsetting $2.6 million benefit to our deferred federal tax expense.&amp;#8239;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;In the calculation of provision for income taxes, Florida and Georgia have the most significant state income tax impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;. Related &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Party&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt; Transactions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;All &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;related party&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; transactions are provided in the normal course of business and, unless otherwise noted, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;are measured at the exchange amount, which is the amount of consideration established and agreed to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;by the related parties.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;We are &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;currently&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; a party to a Construction, Operation and Management Agreement (the COMA) with &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;Sabal Trail Management, LLC (the Operator). The Operator has been engaged to develop, construct, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;market and operate our natural gas transmission assets, amongst other administrative responsibilities, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;and is to be reimbursed for all costs incurred in accordance with the COMA. As the Operator is a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;wholly-owned &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;indirect&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; subsidiary of Enbridge, these transactions are inherently related party transactions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;Our balances with the Operator are as follows:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
