&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Property, plant and equipment accruals were $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;1.9&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; million as of December 31, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; and $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;.0 million &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; December 31, 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Amortization expense of intangible assets total $0.4 million &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; December 31, 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;. Estimated amortization expense for 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; through 20&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;30&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; is $0.4 million per year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The composite weighted-average depreciation rate was 1.6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;% for 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; and 1.67% in 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The total amount of AFUDC included in the Statements of Income was insignificant for 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; and 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;9&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;. Long Term Debt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt; (in millions)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table style="width: 100%; margin-left: 1pt; border-collapse: collapse;" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"&gt;
